# LF everywhere: tests/test_vectors.py freezes the SHA-256 of vector FILES
# (byte-exact). core.autocrlf=true checkouts on Windows rewrote LF->CRLF and
# tripped the freeze guard with a false "vectors changed" (2026-08-21).
* text=auto eol=lf
# Golden vectors are write-once bytes — never any conversion at all.
tests/vectors/** -text
